     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi all,<div><br></div><div>here is a tricky question (at least for me):</div><div><br></div><div><p style=\"font-size:14px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;line-height:17.804800033569336px\">I&#39;d like to use gvisTable() with renderGvis({}) to output a matrix. I did not find a way to ask gvisTable to not remove my row names. You can see the problem on the image below and here is the code:</p><pre style=\"margin-bottom:10px;padding:5px;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238);font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,serif;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;word-wrap:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:17.804800033569336px\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">shiny</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">::</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">runApp</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\nlist</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\nui </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">=</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> pageWithSidebar</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n\r\nheaderPanel</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;TEST&quot;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">),</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n\r\nsidebarPanel</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\nhelpText</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&#39;This matrix does not have row names:&#39;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">),</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n\r\nmainPanel</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">    \r\nuiOutput</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&#39;matrix&#39;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">))</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> \r\nserver </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">=</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,139)\">function</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">input</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">output</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">){</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\nlibrary</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">googleVis</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n\r\noutput$matrix </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> renderGvis</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">({</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n\r\nmatrix </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> matrix</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">rep</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">1</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">9</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">),</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">nrow</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">=</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">3</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n\r\nrownames</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">matrix</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> c</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&#39;a&#39;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&#39;b&#39;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&#39;c&#39;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\ncolnames</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">matrix</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> c</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&#39;1&#39;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&#39;2&#39;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&#39;3&#39;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n\r\ngvisTable</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,139)\">as</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">.</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">data</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">.</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">frame</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">matrix</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">))</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">})</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">}</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">)</span></code></pre><p style=\"font-size:14px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;line-height:17.804800033569336px\">Obviously the following code return a matrix with row names, so this means that gvisTable removes them by default.</p><pre style=\"margin-bottom:10px;padding:5px;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238);font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,serif;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;word-wrap:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:17.804800033569336px\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">matrix </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> matrix</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">rep</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">1</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">9</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">),</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">nrow</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">=</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">3</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n\r\nrownames</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">matrix</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> c</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&#39;a&#39;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&#39;b&#39;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&#39;c&#39;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\ncolnames</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">matrix</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> c</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&#39;1&#39;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&#39;2&#39;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&#39;3&#39;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\nmatrix</span></code></pre><p style=\"font-size:14px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;line-height:17.804800033569336px\">Is there a way to achieve this ? Previously I was simply using renderTable({}) on the matrix, but the result is pretty ugly (<a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/22251956/r-shiny-how-to-output-a-good-looking-matrix-using-rendertable/22253224?noredirect=1#comment33799555_22253224\" style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(74,107,130)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/questions/22251956/r-shiny-how-to-output-a-good-looking-matrix-using-rendertable/22253224?noredirect%3D1%23comment33799555_22253224&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792404494738000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3qx5xeXIn1nBam1u6J-xvL\">R shiny: how to output a good-looking matrix using renderTable()</a>)</p><p style=\"font-size:14px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;line-height:17.804800033569336px\">Any advice/suggestion would be highly appreciated.</p><p style=\"font-size:14px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;line-height:17.804800033569336px\">Cheers</p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-TlhWkXwtUQI/Uxn6uaoBfBI/AAAAAAAAAAM/ydWb6imv5w4/s1600/no_row_names_matrix.jpg\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-TlhWkXwtUQI/Uxn6uaoBfBI/AAAAAAAAAAM/ydWb6imv5w4/s1600/no_row_names_matrix.jpg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792404494738000&amp;usg=AOvVaw08oWnXuexa5Ra3rSgIHvOg\"><img src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-TlhWkXwtUQI/Uxn6uaoBfBI/AAAAAAAAAAM/ydWb6imv5w4/s320/no_row_names_matrix.jpg\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"58\"></a></p><p style=\"font-size:14px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;line-height:17.804800033569336px\"><br></p><p style=\"font-size:14px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;line-height:17.804800033569336px\">PS: also posted on SO</p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, Liberation Sans, DejaVu Sans, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:17.804800033569336px\"><a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/22255559/r-shiny-how-to-force-gvistable-to-keep-the-row-names-of-my-data-frame\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/questions/22255559/r-shiny-how-to-force-gvistable-to-keep-the-row-names-of-my-data-frame&amp